What is EJS Mate?

EJS vs EJS-Mate

Main Idea

EJS already allows code reuse using include.

But ejs-mate makes reuse easier by giving a layout system.

Normal EJS

t ejs

<%- include("partials/navbar") %>

<h1>Home Page</h1>

<- include("partials/footer") %>

Here, every page must manually include navbar and footer.

With ejs-mate

t ejs

<% layout("layouts/boilerplate") %>

<h1>Home Page</h1>

The common HTML structure is written once in boile plate.ejs

